 extraction in the study.', 'A convolutional neural network architecture used as a backbone for feature extraction.', 'A convolutional neural network used as a backbone for feature extraction in the segmentation models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 2]}, 'ResNet-101': {'type': ['method', 'GENERIC', 'method'], 'description': ['A standard backbone network used in the baseline model for few-shot segmentation.', 'A residual neural network architecture used as a backbone for feature extraction.', 'A convolutional neural network used as a backbone for feature extraction in the segmentation models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2, 2]}, 'Inception': {'type': ['method', 'GENERIC', 'method'], 'description': ['A standard backbone network used in the baseline model for few-shot segmentation.', 'A convolutional neural network architecture used as a backbone for feature extraction.', 'A convolutional neural network used as a backbone for feature extraction in the segmentation models.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2, 2]}, 'MeanIoU': {'type': ['generic', 'generic', 'GENERIC', 'task', 'task'], 'description': ['The evaluation metric used to assess the performance of the segmentation models.', 'The evaluation metric used to assess the performance of the segmentation models.', 'A metric used to evaluate the performance of segmentation models.', 'A metric used to evaluate the performance of the segmentation models. It measures the average intersection over union across all classes.', 'A common evaluation metric used to assess the performance of segmentation models, measuring the average intersection over union across all classes.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 2, 3]}, 'Instance Segmentation': {'type': ['Task', 'GENERIC', 'task', 'task'], 'description': ['A computer vision task that involves identifying and delineating individual objects within an image, going beyond semantic segmentation by distinguishing different instances of the same object class.', 'A computer vision task that involves detecting and segmenting individual objects in an image.', 'A computer vision task that involves detecting and segmenting individual objects of interest within an image.', 'A computer vision task that involves detecting and segmenting individual objects within an image.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3]}, 'Quick Selection Tool': {'type': ['GENERIC'], 'description': ['A feature in Adobe Photoshop used for image annotation, specifically for creating selections of objects or regions within an image, as mentioned in the context of the FSS-1000 dataset annotation process.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Binary segmentation annotation': {'type': ['GENERIC'], 'description': ['A type of annotation where each pixel is labeled as either belonging to the object or not.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Photoshop\'s "quick selection" tool': {'type': ['GENERIC'], 'description': ['A tool used for creating pixelwise segmentation annotations by loosely selecting an object and refining the selection.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Open Image dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset containing 7,186 trainable distinct object classes for classification and 600 classes for detection, making it the largest existing dataset with object classes and location annotations.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'FCN': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A fully convolutional network proposed to solve semantic segmentation, trained end-to-end for dense pixel prediction.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'ILSVRC': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['ImageNet Large Scale Visual Recognition Challenge, a dataset used for visual recognition tasks, containing a subset of 1,000 categories from the larger ImageNet dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'OSLSM': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A two-branch network proposed to solve few-shot segmentation.', 'A method used for few-shot segmentation, serving as a benchmark in the paper. It is compared against the proposed method and evaluated on the FSS-1000 dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 2]}, 'MS COCO': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for object detection, segmentation, and captioning, compared to FSS-1000.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'ImageNet': {'type': ['dataset', 'DATASET', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A large-scale image dataset used for pre-training models.', 'A large image dataset used for pre-training models.', 'A large-scale image dataset used for pre-training models, and its pre-trained weights are used in the study.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 3]}, 'Guided Network': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Another method used for few-shot segmentation, also used as a benchmark and compared against the proposed method. It is evaluated on the FSS-1000 dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'fsPASCAL': {'type': ['dataset', 'DATASET'], 'description': ['A dataset derived from PASCAL VOC 2012, adapted for few-shot segmentation tasks.', 'A few-shot version of the PASCAL VOC dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3]}, 'fsCOCO': {'type': ['dataset', 'DATASET'], 'description': ['A dataset derived from MS COCO, adapted for few-shot segmentation tasks.', 'A few-shot version of the COCO dataset.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3]}, 'MSE': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Mean Squared Error, a loss function used in the model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'Model III': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A model trained on FSS-1000.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Model VI': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A model pre-trained on COCO and finetuned on FSS-1000.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'GrabCut': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['An algorithm used for image segmentation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Photoshop': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Software used for image annotation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'UC Merced Land Use Dataset': {'type': ['dataset'], 'description': ["A dataset used in the study, specifica